{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22458","headline":"桐花 · 白居易","name":"桐花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春令有常候，清明桐始发。\n何此巴峡中，桐花开十月。\n岂伊物理变，信是土宜别。\n地气反寒暄，天时倒生杀。\n草木坚强物，所禀固难夺。\n风候一参差，荣枯遂乖剌。\n况吾北人性，不耐南方热。\n强羸寿夭间，安得依时节。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}